---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Unpeeragogy" description="Unpeeragogy — la decostruzione radicale della teoria peer-to-peer, confrontata con la nuda realtà operativa quotidiana.">
  <section class="py-16 text-center" data-pagefind-body>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">
      ⧩ Unpeeragogy
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      La decostruzione della teoria accademica della peeragogy, confrontata 
      con la nuda realtà operativa quotidiana. <em>Due colonne. Una verità.</em>
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
      <a href="/introduction/" class="rounded-lg bg-(--color-accent) px-6 py-3 text-white font-semibold hover:bg-(--color-accent-light) transition-colors">
        Inizia a Leggere ⿻
      </a>
      <a href="https://github.com/pyragogy/unpeeragogy" target="_blank" class="rounded-lg border border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-600 px-6 py-3 font-semibold hover:bg-stone-100 dark:hover:bg-stone-800 transition-colors">
        GitHub → 
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-8">Sezioni Principali</h2>
    <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <a href="/introduction/" class="pattern-card">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-(--color-accent)">Introduction</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">Teoria vs realtà — il divario tra il manuale e la pratica.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/motivation/" class="pattern-card">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-(--color-accent)">Motivation</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">La motivazione come scusa. Il free-rider accademico.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/patterns/" class="pattern-card">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-(--color-accent)">Peeragogy in Practice</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">Pattern? Trucchi. Stanchezza da coordinamento.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/convening/" class="pattern-card">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-(--color-accent)">Convening a Group</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">Il consenso paralizzante. Riunire la gente non è un pattern.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/organizing/" class="pattern-card">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-(--color-accent)">Organizing a Learning Context</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">La dittatura benevola. Organizzare è micro-management.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/cooperation/" class="pattern-card">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-(--color-accent)">Cooperation</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">Cooperazione? Competizione travestita. Il conflitto inespresso.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12 border-t border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Cos'è Unpeeragogy?</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="p-6 border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-stone-800">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-(--color-accent)">📖 Colonna Sinistra — Peeragogy</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">I testi storici del Peeragogy Handbook. La teoria, i pattern, la visione accademica dell'apprendimento collaborativo. Inalterati, rispettati, ma non sacri.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 border border-red-200 dark:border-red-800 rounded-lg bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-900/20">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-red-500">⚡ Colonna Destra — Unpeeragogy</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">La decostruzione. Anti-pattern operativi, fallimenti reali, attriti umani. L'Agente Perturbatore del Pattern che smonta ogni certezza. Giscus vive qui.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-sm">
      <span class="rounded-full bg-stone-100 dark:bg-stone-800 px-3 py-1">CC Zero — Public Domain</span>
      <span class="rounded-full bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-900/30 text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 px-3 py-1">Agente Perturbatore Attivo</span>
      <span class="rounded-full bg-stone-100 dark:bg-stone-800 px-3 py-1">Dual-View Reading</span>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>